# Strict allowlist for Antigravity IDE VSIX packaging.
# Everything is excluded by default; only the bundled extension, 256x256 icon, and slim docs are shipped.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!assets/icon.png
!dist-stage/ide/extension.js

# Explicit exclusions (defense-in-depth; never shipped in VSIX)
readme_CN.md
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md
AGENTS.md
docs/**
src/**
tests/**
scripts/**
app-plugin/**
out-tsc/**
**/*.map
